\section*{The representation exercise}

The exercise that weighs a dictionary against the class shows the
dictionary beside [[Book]]'s constructor with didactic's
[[\codebycode]], which reads both sides from files.  The dictionary is
not a program the solutions run, so its file is tangled here, where it
is never woven, and the exercise shows it once.

<<[[book_dict.py]]>>=
ronja = {
    "title": "Ronja Rövardotter",
    "author": "Astrid Lindgren",
    "pages": 235,
    "read_pages": 0,
}
@
